1
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,480
Mom.

2
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,600
I saved Premier Medical Hall.

3
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,199
And I took down the Wang Family.

4
00:00:29,519 --> 00:00:30,399
Dad and Ren Ran

5
00:00:31,399 --> 00:00:32,280
are both doing well.

6
00:00:34,759 --> 00:00:35,880
We all miss you so much.

7
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:38,920
Oh, and Mom,

8
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:41,719
Ruo Jin and I

9
00:00:43,119 --> 00:00:43,960
got married.

10
00:00:45,159 --> 00:00:46,960
She also gave you an

11
00:00:47,119 --> 00:00:48,759
incredibly adorable little granddaughter.

12
00:00:53,119 --> 00:00:53,520
Ruo Jin,

13
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,039
come offer incense

14
00:00:57,039 --> 00:00:57,759
for Mom.

15
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:16,120
No!

16
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,120
You called the police!

17
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:21,159
I won't let anyone off!

18
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,159
No, no!

19
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,000
Ruo Jin!

20
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,879
It's all my fault!

21
00:01:30,719 --> 00:01:31,239
I'm to blame!

22
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:31,480
Ruo Jin!

23
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:32,879
It's all my fault!

24
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:35,200
I'm a sinner, I deserve to die!

25
00:01:35,239 --> 00:01:36,000
Ruo Jin!

26
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,280
Ruo Jin!

27
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,280
Feifan.

28
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,159
Feifan, it was me.

29
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:49,079
I got Auntie Ren killed.

30
00:01:49,599 --> 00:01:51,799
I ruined the entire Ren family.

31
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:54,079
I'm a sinner against the Ren family.

32
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:56,959
It's all my fault, Feifan.

33
00:01:56,959 --> 00:01:57,599
Ruo Jin.

34
00:01:58,319 --> 00:01:59,840
Ruo Jin, Ruo Jin!

35
00:02:01,159 --> 00:02:01,599
Ruo Jin!

36
00:02:02,920 --> 00:02:03,480
Feifan.

37
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:05,280
I don't want to leave you.

38
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,400
We finally made it through.

39
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,840
I don't want to leave you.

40
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,360
I'm begging you.

41
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:13,120
Can't you cure anything?

42
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,840
Please save me, Feifan.

43
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,120
Help me.

44
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,879
Please, save me.

45
00:02:18,879 --> 00:02:21,759
Feifan, I'm begging you.

46
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:22,719
Ruo Jin.

47
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:23,719
Ruo Jin.

48
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:25,680
Ruo Jin, look at me.

49
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,240
It's me, Feifan.

50
00:02:29,319 --> 00:02:30,680
None of this is your fault.

51
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:39,400
It's all over now.

52
00:02:40,199 --> 00:02:41,159
It's not your fault.

53
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,319
None of it has anything to do with you.

54
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,439
Don't blame yourself.

55
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:04,120
Xu Ruo Jin.

56
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,759
The one who should be in chains

57
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,759
is you.

58
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,199
Listen.

59
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:15,400
Inside this room,

60
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,960
every footstep is proof of your guilt.

61
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,039
Ruo Jin!

62
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:27,800
Ruo Jin!

63
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:30,639
Ruo Jin!

64
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:53,400
I got on the phone with my mentor.

65
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:55,919
Professor Andrew sent me some materials.

66
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,680
They're recent overseas cases

67
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,159
of treating similar conditions.

68
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,319
Okay, and then?

69
00:04:00,879 --> 00:04:01,759
I forwarded them to you.

70
00:04:01,759 --> 00:04:02,439
Sent me what?

71
00:04:02,439 --> 00:04:03,240
The case files.

72
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,599
Why send me case files?

73
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,319
What I need is a treatment method.

74
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:07,919
If necessary,

75
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,879
I can take Ruo Jin to England for treatment.

76
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:12,960
I told you, it's not that simple.

77
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,800
There are two little people inside Ruo Jin.

78
00:04:15,919 --> 00:04:17,560
Once she's triggered by outside stimuli,

79
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,800
those two little people start fighting.

80
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,360
She's been using her vital energy to keep it in check.

81
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:25,000
But every time those two fight,

82
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,600
her vital energy takes a serious hit.

83
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:28,439
If this keeps up,

84
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,120
her body will give out sooner or later.

85
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,199
Out with it.

86
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:36,160
How did you trigger her this time?

87
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,519
I just took her

88
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:41,560
to offer incense at my mother's memorial.

89
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:43,920
Told her the Wang Family had been brought to justice,

90
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:45,240
and that Ruo Jin and I got married.

91
00:04:45,759 --> 00:04:47,480
Like I just said,

92
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:49,800
Ruo Jin has two triggers.

93
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:52,879
One of them is your mother.

94
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,000
When did you ever tell me that?

95
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:56,480
I just told you.

96
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,800
Why didn't you say so earlier?

97
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,079
So what's the other trigger?

98
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:00,000
Wang Wenhao.

99
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:01,360
But Wang Wenhao's already been brought to justice.

100
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:03,120
But as long as Wang Wenhao lives,

101
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,759
she won't have a moment's peace.

102
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,279
You two, stop arguing! Something's happened.

103
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,560
I just got word.

104
00:05:09,800 --> 00:05:10,879
Wang Wenhao escaped.

105
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,480
What?

106
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,160
He escaped?

107
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,399
Prison break.

108
00:05:13,839 --> 00:05:16,120
Before dying, Wang Chengren bribed two guards.

109
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:18,199
Wang Wenhao escaped hidden in an ambulance.

110
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:19,920
He's wanted across the city now.

111
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,399
This is bad.

112
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:21,600
Young Master Gu,

113
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,120
head to Premier Medical Hall right away.

114
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:25,480
Take my dad, Ren Ran, and Ruo Jin to your safe house.

115
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,199
I'll pull some strings.

116
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:28,600
Whatever it takes,

117
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,240
we have to find Wang Wenhao.

118
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:30,879
Got it.

119
00:05:35,079 --> 00:05:35,639
Hey, Dad.

120
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,279
Pack quickly. Young Master Gu is coming to pick you up.

121
00:05:38,879 --> 00:05:41,199
You'll need to stay at the safe house for a few days.

122
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,839
I'm trusting you and Ren Ran to look after Ruo Jin.

123
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:44,920
Shh.

124
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:51,079
You're afraid Wang Wenhao will come after you for revenge?

125
00:05:51,079 --> 00:05:52,319
Of course he'll come after me.

126
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,759
I have to prepare for the worst.

127
00:05:56,079 --> 00:05:58,000
The police are hunting him everywhere.

128
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,920
I bet he wouldn't dare go to Premier Medical Hall.

129
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:03,560
But I don't want Ruo Jin to be scared in the slightest.

130
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,639
Actually, there's another possibility.

131
00:06:08,360 --> 00:06:11,800
He'll try every way to flee North City and hide.

132
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:14,439
Didn't you just say it yourself?

133
00:06:14,439 --> 00:06:15,879
As long as Wang Wenhao isn't brought to justice,

134
00:06:15,879 --> 00:06:17,519
Xu Ruo Jin won't have a moment of peace.

135
00:06:18,199 --> 00:06:19,399
If it's as you said,

136
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,480
and he's left North City,

137
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,800
wouldn't it be even harder to find him?

138
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:22,680
So what do you want to do?

139
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,399
We split up.

140
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:26,000
You use Gu Yuan's satellite tracking system

141
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,319
to track Wang Wenhao's movements.

142
00:06:27,759 --> 00:06:29,560
We'll look for clues in the underground market.

143
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:30,360
Okay.

144
00:06:31,199 --> 00:06:31,680
Go, hurry.

145
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,480
Thanks for your help.

146
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,240
Once I'm out of the country, I'll repay you.

147
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,439
You should thank your father.

148
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,560
He begged me for help before he died.

149
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,160
You once helped Ren Feifan.

150
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:50,319
Why?

151
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,879
There are no permanent friends,

152
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,319
only permanent interests.

153
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:56,720
He made me lose so much face

154
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:57,920
at the Meniersen Group.

155
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,959
Now he's my enemy.

156
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,600
Good. Straightforward.

157
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:04,839
But given my current situation,

158
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:06,279
I can only rely on you.

159
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:09,560
Once I reach your country,

160
00:07:09,959 --> 00:07:11,439
the Wang Family has assets there.

161
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,360
I'll reward you handsomely.

162
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,720
Don't feed me empty promises.

163
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,560
I want the money I'm owed right now.

164
00:07:19,639 --> 00:07:21,319
I, Wang Wenhao, never owe favors.

165
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,360
I'll wire the money to you now.

166
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,800
Arrange my escape route immediately.

167
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:28,920
I still have a few places to visit in North City.

168
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,399
This one, and this one too.

169
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,399
Ren Feifan, I sent you the location.

170
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:51,560
Gu Yuan is already heading there.

171
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,480
Hurry up.

172
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:53,639
I've got the location.

173
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,920
That's the run-down building where Xu Ruo Jin passed out.

174
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:56,759
The Wang Family's lair.

175
00:07:57,279 --> 00:07:58,720
Wang Wenhao very likely went there.

176
00:07:58,839 --> 00:08:00,839
Okay, you two be careful.

177
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:01,240
Mm.

178
00:08:02,959 --> 00:08:04,000
He's right near you.

179
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,759
Okay, I'll look around.

180
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:10,839
There. Go.

181
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:17,560
Stop!

182
00:08:19,279 --> 00:08:19,800
Get back here!

183
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,360
Stop chasing. You can't outrun a car.

184
00:08:30,959 --> 00:08:31,399
Hey, Ning Le.

185
00:08:31,759 --> 00:08:33,759
I'm sending you a license plate. Track where this car went.

186
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,320
Got it.

187
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,279
There's a police checkpoint up north.

188
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:40,799
He most likely won't go that way.

189
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,840
Let's call the police.

190
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:43,759
Not yet.

191
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:45,639
I'm afraid he's still trying to mislead us.

192
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:47,200
That would only trouble the police.

193
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:48,039
Let's tail him first.

194
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:49,080
Okay.

195
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,440
Ren Feifan, Gu Yuan.

196
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,440
We found that Wang Wenhao's overseas account

197
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,240
just wired a sum to Princess Xinai.

198
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,039
Why don't you go check on Xinai's side?

199
00:08:56,960 --> 00:08:58,279
Okay, we're on our way.

200
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,240
Looks like this Princess Xinai

201
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,799
wants to play both sides for profit.

202
00:09:04,279 --> 00:09:05,000
But it doesn't matter.

203
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,120
Anything money can solve

204
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,399
isn't really a problem at all.

205
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,759
Have a seat.

206
00:09:33,919 --> 00:09:34,919
What did you want to see us about, Princess?

207
00:09:36,559 --> 00:09:37,840
Before I leave North City,

208
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,840
there are a few things I'd like to say to you.

209
00:09:41,639 --> 00:09:42,879
No need to look around, handsome.

210
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,519
Wang Wenhao isn't here.

211
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:50,080
You said you wanted to make a deal.

212
00:09:50,519 --> 00:09:51,120
Name your price.

213
00:09:52,399 --> 00:09:53,399
Before we make the deal,

214
00:09:53,639 --> 00:09:55,200
I have a few heartfelt words to share with you.

215
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,240
I hope you can be a little patient.

216
00:09:57,639 --> 00:09:59,159
I'm afraid I don't have much patience.

217
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,279
If there's no news of Wang Wenhao,

218
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,960
then I'll take my leave.

219
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:03,960
Ren Feifan.

220
00:10:08,120 --> 00:10:09,519
I've traveled all around the world,

221
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:11,399
but I've never met anyone like you.

222
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:16,480
I resent that you don't take me seriously.

223
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,360
You defeated me,

224
00:10:19,039 --> 00:10:20,039
but I admire you.

225
00:10:20,639 --> 00:10:22,279
A healer has a kind heart, and a kind heart is invincible.

226
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:25,360
Neither Wang Wenhao nor I are any match for you.

227
00:10:26,759 --> 00:10:27,240
Understood.

228
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,440
Where's Wang Wenhao?

229
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,279
Wang Wenhao asked me to pass on a message.

230
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:33,480
He killed your mother,

231
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,799
and you took his father's life.

232
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:39,399
Can't the feud between your families finally be settled?

233
00:10:41,879 --> 00:10:43,360
Spare his life,

234
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,840
and he promises never to return to this country.

235
00:10:48,799 --> 00:10:49,720
He'll disappear forever.

236
00:10:50,759 --> 00:10:51,759
And what if I refuse?

237
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,960
I know Wang Wenhao paid you a huge sum.

238
00:10:55,799 --> 00:10:57,080
As long as you hand him over,

239
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:59,000
I'll pay you double.
